	(descr "ESP32-S3 general-purpose development board, based on ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 or ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U,It has all the ESP32-S3 pins exposed and is easy to connect and use. Pads 23 to 44 each have a second hole 2.54 mm further out, on the same copper, for boards whose pin rows are 25.4 mm apart (HW-678).")
